  "description": "Box as a writeable IFileProvider: read, write, append, list, copy and move files in a Box folder through IWriteableFileProvider, on the Box .NET SDK (Box.Sdk.Gen), with JWT sign-in, chunked uploads, byte ranges pinned to a file version and Box download URLs. The same API as the local disk, Azure Blob, Amazon S3, MinIO, Google Cloud Storage and SharePoint providers.",
